# CODE-SIGNING CERTIFICATES AND KEYS — NEVER COMMIT.
# This repo is public. A signing cert in a public repo means anyone can ship a
# binary that Windows says is us — on a MEDICAL app. Found SiliconScaffolding
# .ChaosCommand_cert.pfx sitting untracked and unignored on 2026-07-21, one
# `git add -A` from being permanent. Belt and suspenders, by extension.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.keystore
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
*.p8
# (License SIGNING keys live in E:\Ace\chaos-command-licensing\SECRETS.env,
#  outside this repo entirely. Only the PUBLIC key belongs in license.rs.)

